<title>UK: Nikko Europe appoints new international economist.</title>
<headline>Nikko Europe appoints new international economist.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Europe plc, the European investment banking arm of Nikko Securities, said on Thursday it had appointed Eric Fishwick as international economist mainly covering the Japanese economy and the JGB market.</p>
<p>Nikko Europe said in a statement Fishwick would join in early January from IBJ International where he was a senior economist and head of yen analysis for the last five years.</p>
<p>Fishwick replaces Stuart Thomson who has left the company.</p>
<p>-- Stephen Nisbet, International Bonds +44 171 6320</p>
